{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"Hegde is correct when he says, “You are putting the question to the wrong person.” It is true that the file is an instrument and not a man, and the chaffering of the spirit against the friction of the machinery of the state is an expression of my own impatience only; the raita is in my stomach already, but it is the gesture of hospitality which is important here, and I must not allow my pride to interfere with the simple social bond of the household. I will take the correction, and return to the quiet of the study, where the frictions of the day may be written down before they harden."}}],"created":1795129202,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":134,"prompt_tokens":176,"total_tokens":310,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-oMl6CVACHyBcBqxTy6XgFYJyjKrNxvO0","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":176,"prompt_ms":719.034,"prompt_per_token_ms":4.085420454545455,"prompt_per_second":244.77284801553196,"predicted_n":134,"predicted_ms":4196.576,"predicted_per_token_ms":31.553203007518796,"predicted_per_second":31.69250360293725}}